  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "https://hello.vrchat.com/blog/vrchat-security-update\nFriendly reminder that OSC programs can also be keyloggers. \nVRChat, you should make that clear in your blog post if you are going to mention modded clients also being keyloggers. If you want to keep the userbase safe by warning them of the risks, you should warn of all the potential risks. Not just the one. Please update your blogpost to include OSC.\nSaying modded clients can have keyloggers without mentioning the same for unverified OSC programs, could be overlooked by some users and make non tech savy people think that OSC is always safe.",
